{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for the ultimate face-off!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this tower defense gong show, small town hockey players Max and Finley must adapt their skills to a frozen apocalypse and bring back the warmth. Play solo or couch co-op as you activate furnaces across the world and hold the line against waves of frost zombies using a combination of slap shots, trap building and fisticuffs to both bring (and bring back) the heat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trap Building - </strong>Build and upgrade a variety of makeshift traps like puck launchers, barricades, and other hockey-inspired contraptions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Defense - </strong>Each furnace is a self-contained tower defense battle. Plan your setup, protect the heat, and survive escalating waves of enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <strong>Hockey Fueled Combat - </strong> Slapshots, slashing, and body checks - use your sweet hockey skills to take down any frost zombies that slip past your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Modes - </strong>From Rookie to Veteran, choose a difficulty that fits your skill level.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability -</strong> Every furnace features a scoring system, giving you plenty of chances for new plays and epic comebacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between Battles -  </strong>Stay warm, recover health, and gather resources as you travel to the next furnace.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story - </strong>Follow Max and Finley's journey from small-town underdogs to unlikely heroes as they uncover the mystery behind the endless frost.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization - </strong>Deck out your characters in different gear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572260/extras/d7341df5baf00bb7f111339e1aba586d.avif?t=1770856925\" width=588 height=220 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1572260?t=1770856925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770856925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572260/7f5007bf9592b302f7671897b1d5e807e3890877/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770856925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572260/7f5007bf9592b302f7671897b1d5e807e3890877/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770856925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for the ultimate face-off!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this tower defense gong show, small town hockey players Max and Finley must adapt their skills to a frozen apocalypse and bring back the warmth. Play solo or couch co-op as you activate furnaces across the world and hold the line against waves of frost z